# PixelForge Design Language — Light Theme

## Core feeling
Professional creative software. Trustworthy. Precise. Quiet confidence.
The user must feel: "This team knows what they're doing."

## NOT allowed
- Purple/indigo neon gradients (the #1 AI template tell)
- Glowing blobs behind headlines
- Glass morphism everywhere
- Random 3D spheres or abstract shapes
- Excessive border-radius (>12px on cards, >8px on buttons)
- Bouncy animations
- Fake "AI sparkles" icons
- Stock-photo hero images of people pointing at screens

## Color tokens (define in `globals.css` as CSS variables)
Light theme base:
--color-bg: #fafafa
--color-surface: #ffffff
--color-surface-raised: #f5f5f4
--color-border: #e5e5e3
--color-border-strong: #d4d4d0

Text:
--color-text-primary: #1a1a1a
--color-text-secondary: #52525b
--color-text-muted: #8a8a93
--color-text-inverse: #fafafa

Brand palette (from identity guide):
--color-brand-navy: #0C1127
--color-brand-deep: #011F55
--color-brand-teal: #1E82A2
--color-brand-light: #6EC1E4

Accent (single, restrained — teal from brand):
--color-accent: #1E82A2
--color-accent-hover: #176D89
--color-accent-subtle: #E8F6FB

Semantic:
--color-success: #16a34a
--color-warning: #d97706
--color-error: #dc2626
--color-info: #0284c7

Dark theme (toggle only — light is default):
--color-bg-dark: #0a0a0b
--color-surface-dark: #141416
--color-text-primary-dark: #f5f5f4

## Spacing (8px grid, strict)
Allowed values only: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 96, 128
Reject any padding/margin that is not on this scale.
Exception: touch targets may use 44px min height/width.

## Typography rules
- Body text: minimum 16px. 15px only in dense UI, never in reading flow
- Line height: 1.6 for body, 1.2 for headings
- Max line length: 68ch for paragraphs
- Font weights: use 3 max (400, 500, 600). No 300
- Headings: tighter tracking (-0.02em) and higher weight contrast

## Buttons and controls
- Primary: solid accent, white text, 8px radius, no gradient
- Secondary: outline with --color-border-strong
- Ghost: transparent, only visible on hover
- Touch targets: minimum 44x44px
- Focus ring: 2px solid --color-accent with 2px offset. Never `outline: none`

## Cards and surfaces
- Border: 1px solid --color-border
- Shadow: `0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)`. No colored shadows
- Radius: 10-12px max on cards, 8px max on buttons
- Padding: 24px default, 32px for hero cards

## Motion
- Duration: 150ms micro, 250ms transitions
- Easing: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion
- No forever-looping auto animations

## Before/After viewer
- Neutral gray backdrop (--color-surface-raised)
- Slider: thin 2px line, small circle grip, high contrast
- Labels: small caps, letter-spacing 0.05em, muted
- Zoom: 25/50/100/200/Fit always visible
